<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets two-week rev repo at 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets two-week rev repo at 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Thursday set a one-week reverse repo tender to drain funds at 18.5 percent, unchanged from its last similar operation on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would accept two bids from participants of a minimum 100 million crowns until 09.45 a.m. (0745 GMT) in the operation.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
